         on the YM2612 and the PSG and hands the sampled sounds to a Z80 program it loads. The only sounds of the 32X part are the two
         jingles of the master SH-2 at the start (unit="pwm"): the 68000 asks for one by writing 0x0106 (or 0x0107) to the first
